    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d943">

                <pb facs="1193" n="1175" sameAs="frus:frus1946v11/pg1175"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.00/1–446: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Paraguay</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Beaulac</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-01-04T12:00:00-04:00">January 4,
                        1946—noon.</date><lb/>[Received 7:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Chiriani<anchor n="1" xml:id="d943-f1"/> told me this morning President<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d943-f2"/> had met with both civilian and military leaders and
                    has authorized him to give me formal assurance that Paraguayan Govt during
                    present year will establish press and political freedom and will hold elections
                    for and install a House of Representatives.</p>
                <p>Chiriani is seeing President tonight and he has agreed to urge President on my
                    behalf to give early publicity to govt’s decisions.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Buenos Aires, Montevideo and Rio de Janeiro.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaulac</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d943-f1" n="1" xml:id="d943-f1-content">
                <p>Juan Horacio Chiriani, Paraguayan Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d943-f2" n="2" xml:id="d943-f2-content">
                <p>Higinio Morínigo.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
